 some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. https://t.co/KYHxFmIMLJ","url":"https://x.com/EducatedMoron/status/2109912846398271869"},{"author_id":"740846832755052545","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:12:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109904974893474142"],"id":"2109904974893474142","in_reply_to_user_id":"1526603809635856384","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109882876057837846","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Amit4Films @Parthib777 @Exoteric_savy I love pandal hopping but physically I’m not very capable. Also I can’t do the all nighter. But manage to see at least 20-30 pandal every year. Start with South. On Chaturthi. Suruchi, Ekdalia, Hindustan park, Tridhara, Deshopriya  and Ballygaunge cultural. the most famous ones.","url":"https://x.com/RitzyB94/status/2109904974893474142"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109902669183922176"]},"author_id":"2098314346581647360","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:02:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109902705678594144"],"id":"2109902705678594144","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"First Time Dragon Pandal In Kolkata 😱\n\n📍Tridhara  Sammilani, kolkata 🥰\n\n #durgapuja #DurgaPuja2026 #kolkatadurgapuja #kolkata #Pujo2026 https://t.co/TLd60Oqwr9","url":"https://x.com/AbhiDasGup74/status/2109902705678594144"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109894554338131968","3_2109894554312970240","3_2109894554338119680","3_2109894554279346176"]},"author_id":"2035449334884610048","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:30:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109894563951419404"],"id":"2109894563951419404","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":17,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"“Durga Puja 2026”\n\nExclusive First Look